              "text": "दो बदमाश बस में लोगों का पैसा छीन रहे थे। do badmāś bas meṁ logoṁ kā paisā chīn rahe the. Two crooks were snatching people's money on the bus."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine or feminine, by the person meant."
            }
          ]
        },
